<!--
  Synthetic objekt/detail answer in which every element, attribute and UDSF the api can write is filled,
  in the api's element order.

  It combines variants no single real answer has at once:
  - buy and rent (KAUF and MIETE_PACHT both 1)
  - the optional equipment elements in <ausstattung> (UDSF moeblierung, ji_ausstattung)
  - media descriptions, 360° pictures and points of interest
  Alternatives one answer cannot hold are not in it: kaufpreis auf_anfrage="1" (then the value is 0),
  max_mietdauer in MONAT or "unbefristet".

  Every free value is unique, so a comparison shows which place a getter reads. Texts name their place
  ("geo.ort", "udsf.etage"); numbers are unique per place. Where the api always writes the same value
  twice (tuernummer/wohnungsnr, anzahl_balkone/anzahl_balkons, anzahl_logia/anzahl_loggias,
  projekt_id/UDSF parent_id, official node/UDSF of the same name), the two places get different
  values on purpose. A difference there is a feature of the fixture, not of the api.
-->
